      "html": "<h3>Other Sports</h3><h4 class=\"sport first\">Youth Olympic Games</h4><p class=\"games-sub\">Dakar · Day 13 of 14 · until Fri 13 Nov</p><ul class=\"standouts\"><li><strong>Shooting:</strong> India took team gold in the 25m pistol, though Manu Bhaker and Esha Singh missed out on Olympic quota places. <a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/india-clinches-25m-pistol-team-gold-medal-manu-bhaker-esha-singh-miss-olympic-quota/article71688289.ece\" rel=\"noopener\">The Hindu</a></li></ul><h4 class=\"sport\">Chess</h4><ul class=\"standouts\"><li>Carlsen won the blitz event at Total Chess Pilot, while Vaishali beat both Niemann and So in upset victories. <a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/vaishali-pulls-off-upset-wins-over-niemann-and-so-carlsen-wins-blitz-event/article71690803.ece\" rel=\"noopener\">The Hindu</a></li><li>Kamad Mishra won the Khelo Chess India classical rating event with a perfect nine wins from nine games. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOQUhKQWJEWVZLOUpUV3d2eWlabGMxbVl5b1I2S2dIOWJHYkx2Qy1Oc0hfdFRQMUN5NUthOHc4RW14S29sNnRuYmdraUtNU3J4S19hRWdFcjF0VWJ3S2djeHl3cnVrU284X1M4TjZMV1hDZTU1UW9mbUJoMm1Ib1B5OUNFUXdTcWVPcUxDN0dOUQ?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener\">ChessBase India</a></li></ul>"
