      "id": "stories",
      "title": "Interesting Stories",
      "html": "<ul class=\"standouts stories\"><li>Conor McGregor&#x27;s manager expects the fighter&#x27;s UFC career to end in late 2027. The comment arrives while McGregor still has plenty to sort out before a comeback fight, so the timeline adds a notable deadline to his return. <a href=\"https://sports.yahoo.com/mma/article/conor-mcgregors-manager-expects-stars-ufc-career-to-come-to-an-end-in-late-2027-234509014.html\" rel=\"noopener\">Yahoo Sports</a></li><li>Tennessee&#x27;s men&#x27;s basketball program published a mock collective bargaining agreement term sheet. It is a non-binding exercise intended to show what a formal deal between athletes and schools might look like, offering a glimpse at where college sports could be heading. <a href=\"https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/tennessee-basketball-mock-cba-offers-233229786.html\" rel=\"noopener\">Yahoo Sports</a></li><li>Several big-spending clubs, namely the Dodgers, Mets, Padres and Blue Jays, are emerging as suitors for Tarik Skubal, the top free agent on the MLB market. Agent Scott Boras, true to form, joked that the demand makes for a strong &#x27;Sku-bull market&#x27;. <a href=\"https://sports.yahoo.com/mlb/article/dodgers-mets-padres-blue-jays-emerge-as-tarik-skubal-suitors-as-market-for-top-mlb-free-agent-takes-shape-233934893.html\" rel=\"noopener\">Yahoo Sports</a></li></ul>"
